{
  "name": "Introducing Presentation Canvas",
  "description": "A self-introduction deck that explains what Presentation Canvas is, its features, workflow, and how to get started. Perfect for sharing the project with others.",
  "theme": "dark",
  "slides": [
    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a2e 0%,#16213e 100%);color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}.container{width:880px;text-align:center;}h1{font-size:54px;margin-bottom:8px;color:#fff;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-1px;}h2{font-size:20px;color:#4fc3f7;margin-bottom:24px;font-weight:300;}.tagline{font-size:16px;color:#a0a0b0;line-height:1.6;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;}.badge{display:inline-block;background:#0f3460;color:#4fc3f7;padding:6px 20px;border-radius:20px;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:20px;}</style></head><body><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"badge\">AI-Powered Slide Builder</div><h1>Presentation Canvas</h1><h2>Privacy-first. Local AI. No cloud required.</h2><div class=\"tagline\">Generate government proposals, business pitches, RACI matrices, Gantt charts, and more from a single prompt using Ollama, OpenAI, or any OpenAI-compatible LLM.</div></div></body></html>",

    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.header{padding:35px 40px 0;}.header h2{font-size:14px;color:#4fc3f7;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;}.header h1{font-size:36px;color:#fff;}.content{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 40px 35px;}.grid{width:880px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:16px;}.card{background:#16213e;border:1px solid #2a3a5c;border-radius:10px;padding:24px 20px;}.card .icon{font-size:28px;margin-bottom:10px;}.card h3{font-size:16px;color:#4fc3f7;margin-bottom:8px;}.card p{font-size:13px;color:#a0a0b0;line-height:1.5;}</style></head><body><div class=\"header\"><h2>Why This Tool?</h2><h1>The Problem with Slide Software</h1></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"grid\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\">&#128274;</div><h3>Cloud Dependency</h3><p>Most tools send your data to external servers. Government proposals and sensitive bids can't leave your machine.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\">&#128170;</div><h3>Manual Effort</h3><p>Building RACI matrices, Gantt charts, and quad charts by hand takes hours. Formatting is tedious and inconsistent.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\">&#127912;</div><h3>Limited Control</h3><p>Other AI slide tools lock you into their templates and themes. You can't customize colors, layouts, or structure.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\">&#128196;</div><h3>Export Limits</h3><p>Online tools give you PNG screenshots, not real presentations. Good luck editing those.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\">&#9729;&#65039;</div><h3>No Offline</h3><p>No internet means no slides. Airplanes, classified environments, secure facilities — you're stuck.</p></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\">&#128176;</div><h3>Subscription Walls</h3><p>Monthly fees per seat. Per-export charges. Hidden limits on slides and generations.</p></div></div></div></body></html>",

    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.header{padding:35px 40px 0;}.header h2{font-size:14px;color:#66bb6a;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;}.header h1{font-size:36px;color:#fff;}.content{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 40px 35px;}.features{width:880px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;}.f{display:flex;gap:14px;background:#16213e;border:1px solid #2a3a5c;border-radius:8px;padding:16px;align-items:start;}.f .icon{font-size:24px;flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:center;}.f h3{font-size:15px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:4px;}.f p{font-size:12px;color:#a0a0b0;line-height:1.4;}</style></head><body><div class=\"header\"><h2>How It Works</h2><h1>Presentations from a Single Prompt</h1></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"features\"><div class=\"f\"><div class=\"icon\">&#129302;</div><div><h3>Local AI via Ollama</h3><p>Runs on your machine. No data sent anywhere. Works with any Ollama model.</p></div></div><div class=\"f\"><div class=\"icon\">&#9997;&#65039;</div><div><h3>Describe, Don't Design</h3><p>Type what you want. The AI generates complete HTML slides with proper layout and charts.</p></div></div><div class=\"f\"><div class=\"icon\">&#127919;</div><div><h3>13 Keyword Triggers</h3><p>Say &quot;RACI&quot; or &quot;Gantt&quot; and the AI produces that chart type automatically.</p></div></div><div class=\"f\"><div class=\"icon\">&#128396;&#65039;</div><div><h3>Edit in Place</h3><p>Switch to Edit mode and describe changes. The AI modifies only the selected slide.</p></div></div><div class=\"f\"><div class=\"icon\">&#127912;</div><div><h3>5 Live Themes</h3><p>Dark, Light, Blue, Green, Red — swap instantly. All slides update in real time.</p></div></div><div class=\"f\"><div class=\"icon\">&#128228;</div><div><h3>Export Anywhere</h3><p>PDF for print, PPTX for presenting, HTML for sharing. Full visual fidelity.</p></div></div></div></div></body></html>",

    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.header{padding:35px 40px 0;}.header h2{font-size:14px;color:#ffca28;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;}.header h1{font-size:34px;color:#fff;}.content{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 40px 35px;}.triggers{width:880px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:10px;}.t{background:#16213e;border:1px solid #2a3a5c;border-radius:6px;padding:12px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}.t .kw{font-size:12px;color:#ffca28;font-weight:600;font-family:'Consolas',monospace;white-space:nowrap;}.t .name{font-size:12px;color:#a0a0b0;}.note{font-size:12px;color:#66bb6a;margin-top:14px;text-align:center;}</style></head><body><div class=\"header\"><h2>Global Keyword Triggers</h2><h1>Type a Keyword, Get the Right Chart</h1></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"triggers\"><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"kw\">gov bid / proposal</div><div class=\"name\">Gov Bid Mode</div></div><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"kw\">Gantt / project schedule</div><div class=\"name\">Gantt Chart</div></div><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"kw\">RACI / responsibility</div><div class=\"name\">RACI Matrix</div></div><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"kw\">cost / budget</div><div class=\"name\">Cost Table</div></div><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"kw\">bar chart / column chart</div><div class=\"name\">Bar Chart</div></div><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"kw\">pie / donut chart</div><div class=\"name\">Pie / Donut</div></div><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"kw\">SWOT</div><div class=\"name\">SWOT Analysis</div></div><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"kw\">KPI / dashboard</div><div class=\"name\">KPI Dashboard</div></div><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"kw\">org chart / hierarchy</div><div class=\"name\">Org Chart</div></div><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"kw\">quad chart / 2x2</div><div class=\"name\">Quad Chart</div></div><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"kw\">timeline / roadmap</div><div class=\"name\">Timeline</div></div><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"kw\">risk matrix</div><div class=\"name\">Risk Matrix</div></div><div class=\"t\"><div class=\"kw\">vs / comparison</div><div class=\"name\">Comparison Table</div></div></div><div class=\"note\">&#10003; Triggers work in all modes: Generate, Edit, Script, and Markdown &mdash; not just Government Bid</div></div></body></html>",

    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.header{padding:35px 40px 0;}.header h2{font-size:14px;color:#4fc3f7;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;}.header h1{font-size:36px;color:#fff;}.content{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 40px 35px;}.steps{width:880px;display:flex;gap:20px;}.step{flex:1;background:#16213e;border:1px solid #2a3a5c;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;text-align:center;position:relative;}.step .num{font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#4fc3f7;margin-bottom:8px;}.step h3{font-size:16px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:6px;}.step p{font-size:13px;color:#a0a0b0;line-height:1.5;}.step .arrow{position:absolute;top:50%;right:-16px;font-size:20px;color:#4fc3f7;transform:translateY(-50%);}</style></head><body><div class=\"header\"><h2>Workflow</h2><h1>Four Steps to a Finished Deck</h1></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"num\">1</div><h3>Connect</h3><p>Choose Ollama, OpenAI, Zhipu, or any OpenAI-compatible API. Select your model.</p><div class=\"arrow\">&#8594;</div></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"num\">2</div><h3>Describe</h3><p>Type what you need. Use keyword triggers for charts: &quot;Gantt chart for Q3&quot; or &quot;RACI matrix&quot;.</p><div class=\"arrow\">&#8594;</div></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"num\">3</div><h3>Refine</h3><p>Edit individual slides in natural language. Apply themes, logos, and footer labels.</p><div class=\"arrow\">&#8594;</div></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"num\">4</div><h3>Export</h3><p>Download as PDF, PPTX, or standalone HTML. Ship it.</p></div></div></div></body></html>",

    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.header{padding:35px 40px 0;}.header h2{font-size:14px;color:#ff9800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;}.header h1{font-size:36px;color:#fff;}.content{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 40px 35px;}.layout{width:880px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;}.col{background:#16213e;border:1px solid #2a3a5c;border-radius:10px;padding:20px;}.col h3{font-size:16px;color:#ff9800;margin-bottom:12px;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(255,152,0,0.3);padding-bottom:8px;display:inline-block;}.col ul{list-style:none;padding:0;}.col li{font-size:14px;line-height:2;color:#a0a0b0;padding-left:20px;position:relative;}.col li::before{content:'\\2713';position:absolute;left:0;color:#66bb6a;}</style></head><body><div class=\"header\"><h2>Smart Layout Engine</h2><h1>Every Slide, Perfectly Framed</h1></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"layout\"><div class=\"col\"><h3>Automatic Centering</h3><ul><li>Title slides center in full height</li><li>Content slides center between header and footer</li><li>Flexbox layout prevents overflow</li><li>max-width: 880px on all containers</li><li>Safe margins: 40px left/right, 35px top/bottom</li></ul></div><div class=\"col\"><h3>CSS Variables on Every Slide</h3><ul><li>--slide-width: 960px (16:9 Letter)</li><li>--slide-height: 540px</li><li>--safe-margin: 40px</li><li>--header-height: 90px</li><li>--footer-height: 40px</li></ul></div></div></div></body></html>",

    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.header{padding:35px 40px 0;}.header h2{font-size:14px;color:#4fc3f7;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;}.header h1{font-size:36px;color:#fff;}.content{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 40px 35px;}.providers{width:880px;display:flex;gap:16px;}.provider{flex:1;background:#16213e;border:1px solid #2a3a5c;border-radius:10px;padding:20px;text-align:center;}.provider h3{font-size:17px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px;}.provider .badge{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:12px;}.provider .badge.local{background:#1b5e20;color:#66bb6a;}.provider .badge.cloud{background:#0d47a1;color:#64b5f6;}.provider .badge.any{background:#4a148c;color:#ce93d8;}.provider p{font-size:13px;color:#a0a0b0;line-height:1.5;}</style></head><body><div class=\"header\"><h2>Multi-Provider LLM</h2><h1>Your Model, Your Rules</h1></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"providers\"><div class=\"provider\"><div class=\"badge local\">LOCAL &middot; PRIVATE</div><h3>Ollama</h3><p>Runs on your machine. No internet needed. Works with llama3, mistral, glm4, and any Ollama model.</p></div><div class=\"provider\"><div class=\"badge cloud\">CLOUD &middot; POWERFUL</div><h3>OpenAI</h3><p>GPT-4o and other OpenAI models. Best for complex charts and detailed formatting.</p></div><div class=\"provider\"><div class=\"badge cloud\">CLOUD &middot; POWERFUL</div><h3>Zhipu (GLM)</h3><p>GLM-4 and other Zhipu models. Strong structured output capability.</p></div><div class=\"provider\"><div class=\"badge any\">ANY &middot; FLEXIBLE</div><h3>Custom API</h3><p>Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint. LM Studio, Together AI, DeepSeek — whatever you need.</p></div></div></div></body></html>",

    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.header{padding:35px 40px 0;}.header h2{font-size:14px;color:#ef5350;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;}.header h1{font-size:36px;color:#fff;}.content{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 40px 35px;}.exports{width:880px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:20px;}.export{background:#16213e;border:1px solid #2a3a5c;border-radius:10px;padding:24px;text-align:center;}.export .icon{font-size:36px;margin-bottom:8px;}.export h3{font-size:18px;color:#4fc3f7;margin-bottom:8px;}.export p{font-size:13px;color:#a0a0b0;line-height:1.5;}.export ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin-top:8px;}.export li{font-size:12px;color:#a0a0b0;line-height:1.8;}</style></head><body><div class=\"header\"><h2>Export Options</h2><h1>Deliver Anywhere</h1></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"exports\"><div class=\"export\"><div class=\"icon\">&#128196;</div><h3>PDF Export</h3><p>Print-optimized landscape layout with full background color support.</p><ul><li>Set margins to None</li><li>Enable Background Graphics</li><li>Dark themes render correctly</li></ul></div><div class=\"export\"><div class=\"icon\">&#128640;</div><h3>PPTX Export</h3><p>Each slide becomes a high-res image in a PowerPoint deck.</p><ul><li>Full visual fidelity</li><li>16:9 widescreen format</li><li>Not text-editable</li></ul></div><div class=\"export\"><div class=\"icon\">&#128187;</div><h3>HTML Export</h3><p>Download any session as a standalone HTML viewer file.</p><ul><li>Self-contained, no server needed</li><li>Includes all slides as iframes</li><li>Share via email or USB</li></ul></div></div></div></body></html>",

    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#1a1a2e;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.header{padding:35px 40px 0;}.header h2{font-size:14px;color:#66bb6a;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:8px;}.header h1{font-size:36px;color:#fff;}.content{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 40px 35px;}.features{width:880px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:14px;}.f{background:#16213e;border:1px solid #2a3a5c;border-radius:8px;padding:16px;}.f h3{font-size:14px;color:#66bb6a;margin-bottom:6px;}.f p{font-size:12px;color:#a0a0b0;line-height:1.5;}</style></head><body><div class=\"header\"><h2>Beyond the Basics</h2><h1>More Features</h1></div><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"features\"><div class=\"f\"><h3>&#128221; Session History</h3><p>Every presentation auto-archived. Switch between decks instantly. Pin important sessions.</p></div><div class=\"f\"><h3>&#127912; 5 Live Themes</h3><p>Dark, Light, Blue, Green, Red. Swap instantly — all slides update in real time.</p></div><div class=\"f\"><h3>&#128247; Image Upload</h3><p>Upload images and insert into specific slides with &quot;To Slide N&quot; button.</p></div><div class=\"f\"><h3>&#128206; Logo System</h3><p>Upload once, pick position and size, apply to all slides with one click.</p></div><div class=\"f\"><h3>&#128220; Footer Labels</h3><p>Auto-inject CUI, Company Sensitive, or any label onto every slide.</p></div><div class=\"f\"><h3>&#128196; Template Import</h3><p>Import from JSON, HTML, Markdown, or clipboard. Export template JSON for reuse.</p></div><div class=\"f\"><h3>&#9995;&#65039; HTML Editor</h3><p>Toggle to raw HTML view. Edit any slide's code directly if you want full control.</p></div><div class=\"f\"><h3>&#127909; Presentation Mode</h3><p>Full-screen with keyboard navigation. Arrow keys, spacebar, escape.</p></div><div class=\"f\"><h3>&#128274; Privacy First</h3><p>No accounts, no tracking, no cloud. Your data stays on your machine. Open source.</p></div></div></div></body></html>",

    "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>:root{--slide-width:960px;--slide-height:540px;--safe-margin:40px;--header-height:90px;--footer-height:40px;}*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{width:960px;height:540px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a2e 0%,#16213e 100%);color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}.container{width:880px;text-align:center;}h1{font-size:44px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:12px;}.accent{width:60px;height:3px;background:#4fc3f7;margin:0 auto 20px;}.subtitle{font-size:18px;color:#a0a0b0;margin-bottom:30px;line-height:1.6;}.cta{display:inline-block;background:#4fc3f7;color:#1a1a2e;padding:14px 36px;border-radius:8px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;margin:8px;}.cta.secondary{background:transparent;color:#4fc3f7;border:2px solid #4fc3f7;}.links{margin-top:28px;font-size:14px;color:#a0a0b0;}.links a{color:#4fc3f7;text-decoration:none;}</style></head><body><div class=\"container\"><h1>Get Started</h1><div class=\"accent\"></div><div class=\"subtitle\">Clone the repo, start a local server, and generate your first deck in under 2 minutes.</div><div><a class=\"cta\" href=\"#\">Clone from GitHub</a><a class=\"cta secondary\" href=\"#\">Read the Docs</a></div><div class=\"links\">github.com/norhtecmbarnes-dot/presentation-canvas &middot; Ollama &middot; No signup required</div></div></body></html>"
